<div class="panel">
  <div class="eyebrow" id="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU TAKE IT OFF</div>
  <div class="title" id="title">You stayed.</div>
  <div class="body" id="body1">You just practiced the pause.</div>
  <div class="body-soft" id="body2">The urge will show up again, and when it does, this same practice is here to use.</div>
  <div class="factcard">
    <div class="factlabel">HOW RECOVERY BEGINS</div>
    <div class="factbody" id="factBody">Real recovery starts when you actually stop: heart rate begins to drop within 20 minutes, and carbon monoxide in your blood returns to normal within 12 hours (NHS). A rehearsal doesn't change your body.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="body-soft" id="cta">If you or someone you care about wants a hand with this, thriverlink.com is there.</div>
  <div class="actions">
    <button id="btnBreathe" class="btn secondary">Go again</button>
    <button id="btnDone" class="btn primary">Done</button>
  </div>
  <button id="btnQuit" class="btn ghost">Quit</button>
</div>
